{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_5001_p", "source_sha256": "a20104457832ae62f95c063687979d9d043f5604fc3074e81134d764c7fdf0c6", "ja": "（雪歩が出版社のキャンペーンガールに選ばれた。\n今日は雪歩オススメの本を持ってポスター撮影だ）", "zh": "（雪步被选为出版社的宣传女孩。\n今天要拿着雪步推荐的书拍摄海报。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_5002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "316b076bac20d8552f6fcb9c97867643cd48051250c1b44115049d1311970355", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\nえっと、撮影で使う本のことなんですけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}，您辛苦了。\n那个，关于拍摄时要用的书……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_5003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5a2e45c05c3a0b62b398122c178a4563000ef75eea1d2274ecfed7c1ace45014", "ja": "色々考えてたら、どれもオススメしたくなっちゃって、\nなかなか一つに絞れないんですぅ……。", "zh": "想了很多之后，感觉每一本都想推荐，实在很难只选一本……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_5004_p", "source_sha256": "8d6d6a8fa4d1b683c63490d20c20f99cce19a598eb723f68a206500f811db318", "ja": "候補が多いのはいいことだけど、悩みどころだな。\n撮影に使うのは一冊だから、どうしようか……？", "zh": "候选多是好事，但也让人纠结啊。\n毕竟拍摄时只能用一本，该怎么办呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_5005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a357c420ee7c8b8a02a27ab7016b7a0c0edfd8bb11125ecec70777651c6a74a7", "ja": "だから、あの、{$P$}！　よかったら\nどんな本がいいか、決めてもらえませんか？", "zh": "所以，那个，{$P$}！如果可以的话，\n能请您帮忙决定选哪本书吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_5006_p", "source_sha256": "269c76482a62742f49a38ca00897415574545860b5422211f8995b6577582a74", "ja": "雪歩がそう言うなら、喜んで。なら、今回は……。", "zh": "既然雪步都这么说了，我很乐意。那么这次就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_5007", "source_sha256": "91308b11c572cb677ec30837106f780a43a9ad97ad94bb11fbd737c28ddbcfce", "ja": "可愛い内容の本", "zh": "内容可爱的书", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_5008", "source_sha256": "b715db1cf9f0d5c6c345818f4cbadbeb99b95fd8fcdf52d7ff1eb85d260989a8", "ja": "カッコいい内容の本", "zh": "内容很酷的书", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_5200_p", "source_sha256": "bac3b24ae1bdea43ada7cfb43dded7b0bc2735fc094380fb4aaf9ad99f25ae3e", "ja": "可愛い内容の本がいいんじゃないかな。雪歩の\nイメージにも合うから、オススメしやすいと思う。", "zh": "可爱内容的书比较好吧。而且也符合雪步的\n形象，我觉得推荐起来更容易一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_5201_004yuk", "source_sha256": "cf78b5ac18b8ab9fc1a28c644acad949b7b67302935992722e0bf26ede8ef1fe", "ja": "じゃあ……詩集とかはどうでしょう？　前向きな\n気持ちがぎゅっと詰まった、大好きな本なんですぅ！", "zh": "那么……诗集怎么样？这是我最喜欢的书，里面满满都是积极向上的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_5202_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b58625ab9bf4f4d5987915f5ceebf016d9b3f38f4c89a36df8e4399cc355528f", "ja": "落ち込んだ時に読むと、勇気がもらえる本なので、\nぜひ、みんなにも読んでもらいたいなぁ……♪", "zh": "这是一本在情绪低落时读了就能获得勇气的书，所以也很希望大家都能读一读……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_5300_p", "source_sha256": "bac3b24ae1bdea43ada7cfb43dded7b0bc2735fc094380fb4aaf9ad99f25ae3e", "ja": "可愛い内容の本がいいんじゃないかな。雪歩の\nイメージにも合うから、オススメしやすいと思う。", "zh": "可爱内容的书比较好吧。而且也符合雪步的\n形象，我觉得推荐起来更容易一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_5301_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3a045faf68ac9c9f59263242323841a82591ae933566585aa6dfeea19d170e54", "ja": "えっと、それなら絵本はどうですか？　かわいい子猫が\n表紙に描かれてて、一目ぼれしちゃったんですぅ！", "zh": "那个……这样的话，绘本怎么样？封面上画着一只可爱的小猫，我一眼就喜欢上了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_5302_004yuk", "source_sha256": "65827992d863e262d045921f4b77e069e41f541fc6ae3eabf5f1d7f7b353e547", "ja": "あっ、でも、子猫が親元を離れるシーンがあって……。\nうう、思い出したら、感動で涙が出ちゃいます～～。", "zh": "啊，不过，里面有小猫离开父母身边的场景……  \n呜呜，一想起来，我就感动得流眼泪了～～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_5500_p", "source_sha256": "42c4012f692a890217b87e946c146d467176e1feb68015d823d31e1eecaf1d79", "ja": "じゃあ、カッコいい内容の本にしようか。\nせっかくの機会、いつもと違う一面をアピールしよう！", "zh": "那就选一本内容帅气的书吧。\n难得有这样的机会，去展现平时不同的一面吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_5501_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b462165957a1dc9ee7cb177cb1bf95345589b11ed41210821655ae23068dd68b", "ja": "あっ、それなら、ちょうどいい本を持ってきました！\n家のお弟子さんが読んでた本なんですけど……。", "zh": "啊，那我正好带了一本合适的书来！\n是我家一位弟子在读的书……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_5502_004yuk", "source_sha256": "50c82e2f71e468c2eaec2c1ffa434ef3f0b91f10195a3e29ee18ae270b186d88", "ja": "その、仁義をかけたお話で……。えっと、ちょっと\n怖いシーンもあるけど、胸が熱くなるお話なんですぅ！", "zh": "是关于赌上仁义的故事……那个，虽然也有稍微有点可怕的场面，但会让人热血沸腾的故事哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_5600_p", "source_sha256": "42c4012f692a890217b87e946c146d467176e1feb68015d823d31e1eecaf1d79", "ja": "じゃあ、カッコいい内容の本にしようか。\nせっかくの機会、いつもと違う一面をアピールしよう！", "zh": "那就选一本内容帅气的书吧。\n难得有这样的机会，去展现平时不同的一面吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_5601_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d8891ac5d037ad21414c1ad479fea9411d898293a663db88f0bd7b5f72cc9dac", "ja": "カッコいい本……。ええと、じゃあ、\nサスペンス小説とかはどうですか……？", "zh": "帅气的书……嗯，那要不要试试悬疑小说之类的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_5602_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b3abd55a7e414557bcba0fbc388cdf56ed7f27402045615f198a86bd7098044d", "ja": "主人公の探偵さんが、すごく強くて、カッコよくて。\n……お話はちょっと怖いんですけど……うぅ。", "zh": "主角侦探非常强大，也很帅气。\n……虽然故事有点吓人……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
